# LF everywhere in the working tree, on every machine.
#
# The blobs in this repository are already LF; without this file, a clone on
# Windows with the usual `core.autocrlf=true` writes them out as CRLF, and
# `npm run gate` then fails `prettier --check` on 31 of 33 files - measured on
# 2026-09-07, on a fresh worktree. A gate that cannot go green locally is worth
# no more than no gate at all, and the developer who meets it goes hunting for
# a fault they did not cause.
* text=auto eol=lf
